(text when a match is found. If matching fails, the viewer briefly highlights the) Tj T*
(page. The viewer uses PDF.js through react-pdf and lazy-renders pages. Citations) Tj T*
(refer to physical page positions, not printed page labels. Each document has a) Tj T*
(separate conversation. Chat history and drafts stay in the visitor's browser; history) Tj T*
(is saved in localStorage, while drafts stay in memory. Conversations are not synced) Tj T*
